lions of afterlives and the one she  was in was preferable to most of the  others most importantly her husband  could join her he already knew how to  get to the afterlife even if he didn't  remember he'd figure it out on the way  her husband listened to her instructions  with rapt attention she advised him on  the path he should take once he got to  the desert he should follow the moon on  the left until he reached the valley  where the striders the massive primates  dwelled there he should ask one of the  trees where she had gone and follow that  path she also advised him not to do  anything to anger anyone let the  striders kill him it's their way of  saying hello he'd regenerate with no  harm done but there were fates worse  than death that he should avoid at all  costs getting sent back for one but  before she could finish her advice both  of them realized that the mtf were at  his door hurriedly telling him to delete  the voicemail so the foundation wouldn't  find out she assured him that she had  help from her godlike friend and that  she fully believed in him and that he  should never give up she told him she  loved him forever by shooting mr spiegel  the mtf had inadvertently sent him to  scp-2922-c  along with his wife but the foundation  wasn't done yet  scp-2922 had let them set up operation  galahad a project to send train  foundation operatives into the afterlife  to try and apprehend janet spiegel  before she could bring down the  foundation operation galahad has plenty  more stories where that came from but  we'll cover those a different day now go  check out  scp-2718 what happens after death and  project damarang  scp-3448 half-death mri machine for more  anomalous afterlife action from scp  explained
 

